{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 3120,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the largest body of water in California."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6630,
    "dDurationMs": 4570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is about 25 kilometers wide by 55 kilometers\nlong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11200,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can't even see the other end of this lake."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14230,
    "dDurationMs": 7070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it is home to the most diverse number\nof birds anywhere in the continental US besides"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21300,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Big Bend in Texas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23200,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here is the thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24920,
    "dDurationMs": 4159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This body of water is here by accident."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29079,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me explain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30119,
    "dDurationMs": 6161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back in about the 1900s there were engineers\nworking on irrigating the fields of the American"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36280,
    "dDurationMs": 1299,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "southwest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37579,
    "dDurationMs": 3231,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were using the water from the Colorado\nRiver, but they were also trying to prevent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40810,
    "dDurationMs": 3959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it from flooding, from flooding all this farmland."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44769,
    "dDurationMs": 6621,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now in 1905 they got it a little bit wrong\nand also the Colorado River flooded its banks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51390,
    "dDurationMs": 4989,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and used the channels they were building,\nbasically, to flood this whole plain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56379,
    "dDurationMs": 6140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now this plain is actually about 70 meters,\nover 200 feet, below sea level."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62519,
    "dDurationMs": 3521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are at one of the lowest points in North\nAmerica."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66040,
    "dDurationMs": 6260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the water flooded in here, the entire volume\nof the Colorado River flooded into this plain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72300,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for about two years before they were able\nto stop the flooding."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75840,
    "dDurationMs": 13530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what you are left with is the lake that\nyou can see today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89370,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The low-lying area where the Salton Sea now\nis was formed due to tectonic activity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94410,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are very close to the San Andreas Fault."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97190,
    "dDurationMs": 3490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that also means there is magma very close\nto the surface here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100680,
    "dDurationMs": 41180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes that heat boils up through mud volcanoes\nlike these."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141860,
    "dDurationMs": 5349,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we are actually taking advantage of this\nheat using seven geothermal plants, which"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147209,
    "dDurationMs": 7860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "together generate enough electricity for over\n100,000 homes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155069,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now initially people thought that this lake\nwas just going to dry out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158909,
    "dDurationMs": 3711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is one of the hottest, driest parts of\nthe country."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162620,
    "dDurationMs": 1089,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it didn't."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163709,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The water didn't go away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167379,
    "dDurationMs": 6390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so then people got the idea that they\nwould take advantage of this little accident"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173769,
    "dDurationMs": 4451,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and try to dress this whole place up like\na new Riviera."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178220,
    "dDurationMs": 7210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Here is truly a miracle in the desert,\na whole new outlet for the crowded millions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185430,
    "dDurationMs": 3459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in big cities, a Palm Springs with water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188889,
    "dDurationMs": 3031,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is where you can find the good life in\nthe sun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191920,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today the Salton Riviera..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193810,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e And for a time it worked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195170,
    "dDurationMs": 5670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the 50s and 60s they started building towns\nhere and resorts and celebrities came to this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200840,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "place and people would enjoy the water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203060,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They actually added fish to this lake."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205560,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the fishing was so good you could throw\nin a hook and pull out a fish without even"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209040,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "putting any bait on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210510,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course, there was lots of bird life and\npeople really enjoyed themselves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215290,
    "dDurationMs": 3350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It looked as though everything was going great."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218640,
    "dDurationMs": 4799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Until, well, the lake started to turn a little\nbit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223439,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see, the only real inflows of water to\nthis lake are from agricultural runoff and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228659,
    "dDurationMs": 5521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they bring salt into the lake and there is\nno outflow for this lake, because it is so"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234180,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "low."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235180,
    "dDurationMs": 1690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is already one of the lowest points in\nNorth America."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236870,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is below sea level."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239200,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So all that happens is the water then evaporates,\nleaving the salt behind and the salinity of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244040,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this water increases."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245040,
    "dDurationMs": 6309,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is now about 50 grams per liter, which\nis quite a bit more than seawater."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251349,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that makes it hard for the fish to survive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253239,
    "dDurationMs": 4013,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there are massive fish die-offs, which\ncreate quite a smell."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257252,
    "dDurationMs": 2218,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a bit stinky over here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259470,
    "dDurationMs": 5050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And algal blooms have also occurred making\nthe water this ugly brown color."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264520,
    "dDurationMs": 2369,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wouldn't really want to go swimming in there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266889,
    "dDurationMs": 2881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the resorts have all closed up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269770,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is only a few people left here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271990,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, when you drive around here you find\nthose old resort areas, places where people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277270,
    "dDurationMs": 2570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thought, you know, it was going to be the\nnext Riviera."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279840,
    "dDurationMs": 3949,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now they are deserted, ghost towns."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283789,
    "dDurationMs": 3401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there is boats abandoned up on the shore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287190,
    "dDurationMs": 10280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a kind of depressing place, which is\nstrange, given the kind of natural beauty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297470,
    "dDurationMs": 4950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some people might think that letting this\nlake evaporate is the right thing to do, it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302420,
    "dDurationMs": 1209,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is the natural thing to do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303629,
    "dDurationMs": 7320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It returns it to its state from before we\naccidentally flooded it back in 1905."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310949,
    "dDurationMs": 7081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you look back a bit further you find\nthat there really did used to be a lake here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318030,
    "dDurationMs": 6530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a lake which came and went, but for the last\nseveral thousand years the lake was here more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324560,
    "dDurationMs": 1810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "often than it was not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326370,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it was filled up to a higher level."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331590,
    "dDurationMs": 3669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This whole story makes me thing two things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335259,
    "dDurationMs": 6121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, as humans we have incredible power\nto drastically shape the earth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341380,
    "dDurationMs": 6319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can cause entire seas to disappear and\nwe can create seas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347699,
    "dDurationMs": 7601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the other thing is that in the absence\nof effort, in the absence of our caring, things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355300,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tend towards disorder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357130,
    "dDurationMs": 3129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Things naturally fall apart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360259,
    "dDurationMs": 5491,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I feel like if we don't do anything here,\nthe natural result is going to be messy and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365750,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ugly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366750,
    "dDurationMs": 2770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, if you just look around at what has\nhappened to the towns that have been abandoned"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369520,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the homes, which are crumbling, it looks\nlike a disaster area."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374680,
    "dDurationMs": 4030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It looks as bad as Chernobyl, but there was\nno nuclear accident here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378710,
    "dDurationMs": 5889,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is just a lack of caring."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384599,
    "dDurationMs": 2731,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think this applies to more than just\nthis sea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387330,
    "dDurationMs": 2030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389360,
    "dDurationMs": 7649,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We have this kind of duty to recognize what\nwe do matters and if we don't care, if we"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397009,
    "dDurationMs": 4370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "don't put in the effort, it is not going to\nturn out very well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401379,
    "dDurationMs": 3991,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think that is the lesson of the Salton Sea."
    } ]
  } ]
}
